# 06-skills: Modify and reload a skill

Output skill-update-reload-demo.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Margin 10
Set MarginFill "#282a36"
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "copilot"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "/skills reload"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "/skills info code-checklist"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
